# Settlement artifacts:
#   * track ``{prime}_settlement_{month}_{year}.xlsx`` — canonical
#     human-readable artifact (shared with prime / Sky team).
#   * track ``summary.md`` — text-only deterministic PR-review surface;
#     diffs cleanly in the GitHub UI so reviewers can see headline +
#     per-venue number changes at a glance.
#   * ignore ``provenance.json`` — large (~35 KB), regenerable, and
#     changes on every run (timestamps, source manifest) even when the
#     headline numbers don't move.
settlements/**/provenance.json

